{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs","id":851230,"title":"House Gwydion and the Silver Fangs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-22T11:01:19-07:00","id":851230,"title":"House Gwydion and the Silver Fangs","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I've seen it written in various places online that House Gwydion <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">apparently </span></span></span>has or had an ancient treaty/pact with the Silver Fangs, some going as far to say that the House's flaw of being prone to rages stems from their association/inter-breeding with the tribe. However, none of the forum posts, dated websites, or wikis really give any source(s).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Does anyone know what material gives mention to this? I've browsed through the Book of Houses and either I'm blind, its a subtle mention that I missed, or it isn't there and a complete fabrication.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Does anyone know and could point me to a book where I can confirm this?</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1636-illusive-guy","name":"Illusive Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T14:14:13-07:00","id":851351,"title":"","content":"I have never seen any direct link between House Gwydion and the Silver Fang. As the house of the Falcon which is also the SIlver Fangs tribal totem, their close geographic localization, the fact that they Silver Fang had many high born human kin, and House Gwydion's favorable disposition towards Garou in general; It could be inferred that they would have a strong association with one another.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T15:52:32-07:00","id":851411,"title":"","content":"From Noblesse Oblige: The Book Of Houses.<br /> p. 96 and 101.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QRS10MzlKTW5lVDQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QRS10MzlKTW5lVDQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QRS10MzlKTW5lVDQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QRS10MzlKTW5lVDQ/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5821-neon-sidhe","name":"Neon.Sidhe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5821_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T15:58:05-07:00","id":851416,"title":"","content":"I know that in the book of houses I saw a Merit Forgot its name... suggesting they have a strong association...<br /> <br /> On Gwydion? a question, what do you think they'd do if members of the Iron Paladins were captured by the Unseelie court and offered up for ransom. Think they'd be willing to pay a ransom for them if only to shame them? <br /> <br /> or , especialy if the Iron Paladins in question did truly dreadful things like kill Ailil childlings with cold iron &quot;Do as you see fit, we wont consider it grounds for war&quot; <br /> <br /> thoughts? sorry for the side track but had the idea in my head for a bit, and thought it was a nifty way they could wind up weakening their house.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T18:02:55-07:00","id":851485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neon.Sidhe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=851411#post851411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From Noblesse Oblige: The Book Of Houses.<br /> p. 96 and 101.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QajRBUU9idi14YUE/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7iip0EHCm8QRS10MzlKTW5lVDQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7i...ew?usp=sharing</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, those were the only bits I had found in the book that suggest ties to the Garou, but unfortunately neither explicitly mention the Silver Fangs by name nor of any &quot;ancient pact&quot;. I think the various suggestions of such that I saw online might come down to what Derzhuzad suggests; that there is a natural inclination of interaction between House Gwydion and the Silver Fangs and some people ran with that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1636-illusive-guy","name":"Illusive Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T18:13:07-07:00","id":851494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illusive Guy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=851485#post851485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah, those were the only bits I had found in the book that suggest ties to the Garou, but unfortunately neither explicitly mention the Silver Fangs by name nor of any &quot;ancient pact&quot;. I think the various suggestions of such that I saw online might come down to what Derzhuzad suggests; that there is a natural inclination of interaction between House Gwydion and the Silver Fangs and some people ran with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only part that is weird though is that Kinfolk: Unsung Heroes kind of point the Silver Fang to being more likely to have Sluagh kin then Sidhe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T18:14:54-07:00","id":851495,"title":"","content":"I think it makes more sense that the House Gwydion had ancient pacts with the Fianna, right? Considering the geographic location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5821-neon-sidhe","name":"Neon.Sidhe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5821_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T18:36:33-07:00","id":851509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derzhuzad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=851494#post851494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only part that is weird though is that Kinfolk: Unsung Heroes kind of point the Silver Fang to being more likely to have Sluagh kin then Sidhe.</div> </div> </div> </div>shouldnt sluagh be more a bone gnawer, or Stargazer thing...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T18:42:22-07:00","id":851514,"title":"","content":"You would think... but it says Silver Fang and Shadowlord.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-22T19:24:31-07:00","id":851527,"title":"","content":"I would throw silent striders in there too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T04:27:47-07:00","id":851657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=851527#post851527\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would throw silent striders in there too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Kinfolk book says Eshu are more likely for Silent Striders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-23T22:18:26-07:00","id":852249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derzhuzad</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=851657#post851657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">The only part that is weird though is that Kinfolk: Unsung Heroes kind of point the Silver Fang to being more likely to have Sluagh kin then Sidhe.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It's probably the association of sluagh with Slavic lands. Older books liked to hit the Russia drum hard and constantly when it came to the Fangs. Even their tribebook from 2e, which pointed out that no, they were not all actually from Russia or even vaguely Russian in descent, thanks, and had a number of lineages throughout the old world. Which jived well with Rage Across Russia having every tribe but the Bunyip, Fianna and White Howlers present throughout Russian history (yes, even the Uktena and Wendigo). It's a nice ray of complexity and nuance breaking into the teeming unsightliness of THE ROMANOVS WERE ROYAL WEREWOLVES SILVER FANGS MUST BE RUSSIAN ZOMG!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Kinfolk book says Eshu are more likely for Silent Striders. </div> </div> </div>There are a number of tribes that can probably fill in for each different kith. In fact, given their cultural mores, just about any given Galliard would probably be a good match for an eshu when it comes to shop talk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T05:09:53-07:00","id":852900,"title":"","content":"Fools Luck way of the Commoners vaguely alludes to it... but personally... Im unsure if its anything but both are followers of falcon..<br /> <br /> Think Fiona had a thing with the white howlers, because both are chosen of lion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T09:55:22-07:00","id":853035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/851230-house-gwydion-and-the-silver-fangs?p=852900#post852900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fools Luck way of the Commoners vaguely alludes to it... but personally... Im unsure if its anything but both are followers of falcon..<br /> <br /> Think Fiona had a thing with the white howlers, because both are chosen of lion?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Aha! On pg. 34 &quot;But what I didn't know at the time was that the sidhe, who seemed to have made pacts with everything under the sun and moon, had forged many oaths of support with the werewolves before the Shattering. And not just with the Fianna; House Gwydion used to be pretty tight with the ruling tribe of werewolves, the Silver Furs or White Fangs, can't remember the exact name, which didn't make thing any easier for our lupine allies.&quot;<br /> <br /> Also pg. 69 makes mention of an ancient pact between House Gwydion and the Silver Fangs.<br /> <br /> Wonderful, thank you!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1636-illusive-guy","user":"Illusive Guy","date":". 03-25-2016, 01:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1636-illusive-guy","name":"Illusive Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}